# Orchestration & data-quality

## Orchestration — coordinate the steps

- An orchestrator (Airflow, dbt, cloud) runs the pipeline as a **DAG**
- **Order** — extract → stage → transform → **dims → facts** (§08)
- **Scheduling** — nightly, hourly, or on data arrival
- **Retries & recovery** — auto-retry, resume from checkpoint, **alert**

## Data-quality checks — verify the result

- **Row counts** — expected volume? (a drop = broken feed)
- **Uniqueness / not-null** — PKs unique, FKs resolve
- **Range / domain** — no negative qty, sane dates
- **Reconciliation** — warehouse totals tie to **source** totals
- On failure → **fail or quarantine**, never publish wrong numbers

## Closing the loop

- Orchestration = **reliable** · DQ = **trustworthy** → ready for marts & BI
